nodes/heartlib contains the heartmula and heartcodec model code from HeartMuLa/heartlib
(https://github.com/HeartMuLa/heartlib, commit 5858ca8f1ffe58d62be7c007ea55f1033c5ca456),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (nodes/heartlib/LICENSE). Copied without changes except
for added empty __init__.py files and one docstring in heartcodec/models/encoder.py (`eval()` -> `.eval()`,
so the registry's text scan does not read it as a call). The generation loop in nodes/main.py follows
heartlib/pipelines/music_generation.py, changed to skip torch.compile, size the KV cache to the requested
length, report progress and support cancel.

Model weights are not included. The plugin downloads HeartMuLa/HeartMuLaGen,
HeartMuLa/HeartMuLa-oss-3B-happy-new-year and HeartMuLa/HeartCodec-oss-20260123 from Hugging Face
(Apache License 2.0) at prepare time.
